From: PongPlatform24 <local>
Subject: [PATCH] runtime: bound speculative growth and recover heap-local idle memory

Prepared 22H374 source needs the scoped-heap allocator contract too.
Keep live placements, use the actual size for exact fallback blocks,
and make host imports participate in bounded same-heap reclamation.
The recording Vulkan tests exercise the production allocation path.

